<title>USA: Tucson, Ariz., $10.510 mln won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Tucson, Ariz., $10.510 mln won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $10.510 million of Tucson, Ariz., general obligation bonds, Series 1994 C, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
</text>
